===========================================================================
nm-freebsd has been installed.

Enable the daemon at boot:

    sysrc nm_freebsd_enable=YES

Start it now:

    service dbus restart
    service nm_freebsd start

KDE and GNOME need no extra UI. XFCE users can add "NetworkManager FreeBSD"
from the panel's "Add New Items" dialog after restarting xfce4-panel.

The D-Bus policy installed in %%PREFIX%%/etc/dbus-1/system.d allows all local
users to call the service (there is no polkit integration in this MVP).
Tighten that file if the machine has untrusted local users.
===========================================================================
